tion it with the invest-challenge skill.", "risk": "money", "service": "", "action": "", "due": "2026-10-18"}, {"id": "recurring-review-2026-10", "title": "Review 3 recurring payments (about $7,800.00 a year) and cancel the ones you no longer use", "notes": "Your private data/review.md shows which payee each 'Payments #n' is. You cancel with each merchant.", "risk": "read", "service": "", "action": "", "due": "2026-10-18"}, {"id": "sweep-cash", "title": "Invest $63,647.28 of cash above the reserve", "notes": "Follow the account order in your strategy. You make the transfer.", "risk": "money", "service": "", "action": "", "due": "2026-10-18"}, {"id": "zz-pay", "title": "Pay the canary card", "notes": "", "risk": "money", "service": "", "action": "", "due": "2026-10-20"}, {"id": "paydown-test-flat-2026-10", "title": "Pay Test Flat 2% down to $750.00", "notes": "Transfer the card's current balance minus the target to its bank, then pay the card. Autopay still pays the full statement.", "risk": "money", "service": "", "action": "", "due": "2026-10-23"}, {"id": "paydown-test-grocery-2026-10", "title": "Pay Test Grocery 4% down to $450.00", "notes": "Transfer the card's current balance minus the target to its bank, then pay the card. Autopay still pays the full statement.", "risk": "money", "service": "", "action": "", "due": "2026-10-23"}, {"id": "credit-scores-monthly", "title": "Check both credit scores (Equifax and TransUnion)", "notes": "", "risk": "read", "service": "", "action": "", "due": "2026-11-01"}, {"id": "monthly-review-2026-11", "title": "Monthly money review (5 minutes)", "notes": "Run: bin/cashcast review. Import: add last month's exports to your inbox, run `bin/cashcast import`. Statements: every card closed at or under its target and was paid in full. Bank minimums: no monthly fee was charged; top accounts back up to their keep amounts.", "risk": "read", "service": "", "action": "", "due": "2026-11-02"}, {"id": "zz-every-2026-11-05", "title": "Verify the monthly transfer", "notes": "", "risk": "read", "service": "", "action": "", "due": "2026-11-05"}, {"id": "zz-check-later", "title": "Check the ZZCANARY statement", "notes": "", "risk": "read", "service": "", "action": "", "due": "2026-12-01"}, {"id": "rrsp-deadline", "title": "Decide your RRSP contribution for 2026 (deadline 2027-03-01)", "notes": "The contribution itself is a transfer you make.", "risk": "money", "service": "", "action": "", "due": "2027-03-01"}, {"id": "tax-filing-2026", "title": "File your 2026 tax return", "notes": "Self-employed: file by June 15, but pay any balance by April 30.", "risk": "read", "service": "", "action": "", "due": "2027-04-30"}, {"id": "mortgage-reports", "title": "Pull Equifax and TransUnion reports; dispute errors", "notes": "", "risk": "read", "service": "", "action": "", "due": "2027-05-16"}, {"id": "downgrade-test-costly", "title": "Product-change Test Costly to a no-fee card before its annual fee posts", "notes": "Redeem the cash back first. Call the issuer; keep the same limit.", "risk": "settings", "service": "", "action": "product-change-card", "due": null}, {"id": "keep-active-test-costly", "title": "Put one small subscription on Test Costly so it never sits idle", "notes": "Long-idle cards can be closed by the issuer, which shortens credit history.", "risk": "settings", "service": "", "action": "", "due": null}, {"id": "zz-setting", "title": "Turn on card alerts", "notes": "", "risk": "settings", "service": "", "action": "", "due": null}], "netTotal": {"total": 77552.29, "byKind": {"cash": 73447.28, "crypto": 1578.25, "investment": 2526.76}, "changes": [], "history": [{"date": "2026-10-18", "total": 77552.29}], "ranked": [{"id": "cashback-routing", "title": "Pay each spending category with the card the cash-back section names", "section": "cashback", "netEffect": 194.2, "cashOut": null, "why": "Compared with putting everything on your best single card.", "refused": []}, {"id": "invest-plan:cash-drag", "title": "Keep the $63,647 above your reserve safe, at the best rate (needed in about 10 months) (range $60 to $120 a year; long-run, not a forecast)", "section": "invest_plan", "netEffect": 90.05, "cashOut": null, "why": "You need this money within 10 months, too soon for stocks. A high-interest account, GIC or cash ETF pays about 2.4% versus your 2%. If it is for a first home, up to $8,000 of it can sit in your FHSA in the same safe holdings: the contribution is deductible (about $3,473 less tax once, at your marginal rate) and a withdrawal for the home is tax-free.", "refused": []}], "refused": [], "stale": [], "missing": ["Kraken ZZCANARY: no CAD price"]}, "cashback": {"gross": 1808.0, "net": 968.0, "cardFees": 150.0, "serviceFees": 540.0, "membershipFees": 150.0, "routes": [{"category": "recurring", "card": "Test Grocery 4%", "amount": 960.0, "rate": 0.04}, {"category": "rent", "card": "Test Grocery 4%", "amount": 24040.0, "rate": 0.025}, {"category": "other", "card": "Test Flat 2%", "amount": 28440.0, "rate": 0.02}, {"category": "rent", "card": "Test Flat 2%", "amount": 11960.0, "rate": 0.005000000000000001}], "bankPaid": {}}, "holdings": null, "connectors": [{"id": "bmo", "name": "BMO Bank of Montreal", "kinds": ["bank", "card"], "formats": ["generic-csv", "ofx"], "noExport": "", "api": null, "actions": [{"id": "download-transactions", "title": "Download transactions (CSV, or QFX/OFX)", "risk": "read", "via": ["browser"]}, {"id": "read-balances", "title": "Read the chequing and credit card balances (for bin/cashcast transfers)", "risk": "read", "via": ["browser"]}, {"id": "send-etransfer", "title": "Send an Interac e-Transfer", "risk": "money", "via": ["human"]}]}, {"id": "casa", "name": "Casa", "kinds": ["crypto"], "formats": ["casa-csv", "crypto-generic-csv"], "noExport": "", "api": null, "actions": [{"id": "export-transaction-history", "title": "Export transaction history as CSV", "risk": "read", "via": ["browser"]}, {"id": "check-key-health", "title": "Check when each key last passed a health check", "risk": "read", "via": ["browser", "human"]}, {"id": "check-vault-balance", "title": "Check the vault balance", "risk": "read", "via": ["browser"]}, {"id": "send-bitcoin", "title": "Send bitcoin from the vault", "risk": "money", "via": ["human"]}]}, {"id": "chexy", "name": "Chexy", "kinds": ["rent", "payments"], "formats": [], "noExport": "Chexy has no transaction export we could find. Each rent payment and its fee is charged to your credit card, so it shows up in that card's bank export. Import the card statement instead.", "api": null, "actions": [{"id": "change-rent-payment-card", "title": "Change the card that pays rent", "risk": "settings", "via": ["browser"]}, {"id": "check-next-charge", "title": "Check the next charge date and amount", "risk": "read", "via": ["browser"]}, {"id": "check-credit-builder-status", "title": "Check Credit Builder status", "risk": "read", "via": ["browser"]}, {"id": "renew-or-cancel-membership", "title": "Renew or cancel the membership", "risk": "money", "via": ["human"]}, {"id": "change-rent-amount-or-date", "title": "Change the rent amount or due date", "risk": "money", "via": ["human"]}]}, {"id": "cibc", "name": "CIBC", "kinds": ["bank", "card"], "formats": ["ofx"], "noExport": "", "api": null, "actions": [{"id": "download-transactions", "title": "Download transactions (QFX or OFX)", "risk": "read", "via": ["browser"]}, {"id": "read-balances", "title": "Read the chequing and credit card balances (for bin/cashcast transfers)", "risk": "read", "via": ["browser"]}, {"id": "product-change-card", "title": "Product-change a credit card", "risk": "settings", "via": ["human"]}, {"id": "send-etransfer", "title": "Send an Interac e-Transfer", "risk": "money", "via": ["human"]}]}, {"id": "etrade", "name": "E*TRADE from Morgan Stanley", "kinds": ["broker"], "formats": ["etrade-transactions-csv", "etrade-stockplan-csv", "etrade-benefit-rs", "etrade-benefit-espp", "etrade-gains-losses", "etrade-stockplan-pdf"], "noExport": "", "api": "oauth1", "actions": [{"id": "download-transactions", "title": "Download brokerage transactions", "risk": "read", "via": ["browser", "api"]}, {"id": "download-stockplan-gains-losses", "title": "Download stock plan gains and losses", "risk": "read", "via": ["browser"]}, {"id": "download-benefit-history", "title": "Download stock plan benefit history", "risk": "read", "via": ["browser"]}, {"id": "check-upcoming-vests", "title": "Check upcoming vests", "risk": "read", "via": ["browser"]}, {"id": "sell-shares", "title": "Sell shares", "risk": "money", "via": ["human"]}]}, {"id": "google-sheets", "name": "Google Sheets", "kinds": ["sheets"], "formats": ["generic-csv"], "noExport": "", "api": "oauth2", "actions": [{"id": "download-sheet-csv", "title": "Download a sheet as CSV", "risk": "read", "via": ["browser"]}, {"id": "api-read-values", "title": "Read values through the API", "risk": "read", "via": ["api"]}, {"id": "write-forecast-tab", "title": "Write a forecast tab", "risk": "settings", "via": ["api", "browser"]}]}, {"id": "kraken", "name": "Kraken", "kinds": ["crypto", "fx"], "formats": ["kraken-ledger-csv"], "noExport": "", "api": "api_key", "actions": [{"id": "export-ledgers", "title": "Export ledgers as CSV", "risk": "read", "via": ["browser", "api"]}, {"id": "check-balances", "title": "Check balances (web or read-only API key)", "risk": "read", "via": ["browser", "api"]}, {"id": "withdraw-cad", "title": "Withdraw CAD to a bank account", "risk": "money", "via": ["human"]}, {"id": "buy-or-sell-crypto", "title": "Buy or sell crypto", "risk": "money", "via": ["human"]}]}, {"id": "moneywiz", "name": "MoneyWiz", "kinds": ["budgeting"], "formats": ["moneywiz-database", "moneywiz-csv"], "noExport": "", "api": null, "actions": [{"id": "sync-from-exports", "title": "Add the missing bank and card rows to MoneyWiz (bin/cashcast moneywiz sync)", "risk": "settings", "via": ["api"]}, {"id": "fix-listed-rows", "title": "Check the rows listed in out/mon